GIVEN
    `the offer is made in connection with an offer for the acquisition by or on behalf of a person of some or all of the shares, or of some or all of the shares of a particular class, in a corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer made in connection with an offer for the acquisition, by or on behalf of a person, of some or all of the shares in a corporation (that is not a company), or some or all of the shares of a particular class in it?
    `the acquisition offer is made to all members of the corporation, or all members holding shares of that class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the acquisition offer made to all members of the corporation, or all the members holding shares of that class?
    `the person already holds shares in the corporation and the acquisition offer is made to all other members, or all other members holding shares of that class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where the person already holds shares in the corporation, is the acquisition offer made to all other members of the corporation, or all other members holding shares of that class?
    `the acquisition offer complies with the Take-over Code as though the Take-over Code is applicable to it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the acquisition offer comply with the Take-over Code as though the Take-over Code were applicable to it?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 273(1)(ca) the offer is made in connection with an acquisition offer for the shares of a corporation that complies with the Take-over Code` MEANS
    IF `the offer is made in connection with an offer for the acquisition by or on behalf of a person of some or all of the shares, or of some or all of the shares of a particular class, in a corporation` AND (`the acquisition offer is made to all members of the corporation, or all members holding shares of that class` OR `the person already holds shares in the corporation and the acquisition offer is made to all other members, or all other members holding shares of that class`) AND `the acquisition offer complies with the Take-over Code as though the Take-over Code is applicable to it`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "it is made in connection with an offer for the acquisition by or on behalf of a person of some or all of the shares in a corporation or some or all of the shares of a particular class in a corporation"

