    `the proposed compromise or arrangement and the execution of it complies with the Take-over Code as though the Take-over Code is applicable to it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the proposed compromise or arrangement, and the execution of it, comply with the Take-over Code as though the Take-over Code were applicable to it?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
