    `SDRs with units in the business trust as the underlying securities are listed for quotation on the approved exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are SDRs with units in the business trust as the underlying securities listed for quotation on the approved exchange?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 273(1AC) the units in the business trust are treated as listed for quotation on the approved exchange` MEANS
    IF `the units in the business trust are listed for quotation on the approved exchange` OR `SDRs with units in the business trust as the underlying securities are listed for quotation on the approved exchange`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "units in a business trust are treated as being listed for quotation on an approved exchange if SDRs with units in the business trust as the underlying securities are listed for quotation on the approved exchange"

§ `s 273(1)(cd) to (cm): offers to existing holders`


-- src:43461 | (cd) it is an offer of securities (not being SDRs) or
-- src:43462 | securities‑based derivatives contracts of an entity —
-- src:43464 | (i) being an entity which is formed or constituted in
-- src:43465 | Singapore or otherwise, whose securities or
-- src:43466 | securities‑based derivatives contracts are not listed
-- src:43467 | for quotation on an approved exchange; or
-- src:43469 | (ii) being an entity which is not formed or constituted in
-- src:43470 | Singapore, whose securities or securities‑based
-- src:43471 | derivatives contracts are listed for quotation on an
-- src:43472 | approved exchange and such listing is not a primary
-- src:43473 | listing,
-- src:43475 | (cd) where the offer is made to —
-- src:43477 | (iii) existing members or debenture holders of that entity;
-- src:43478 | or
-- src:43480 | (iv) existing holders of SDRs with shares or debentures
-- src:43481 | of that entity as the underlying securities,
-- src:43483 | (cd) (called X in this paragraph), whether or not the offer is
-- src:43484 | renounceable in favour of persons other than X;
@ref s 273(1)(cd) (src:43461-43484)
GIVEN
    `the offer is an offer of securities (not being SDRs) or securities-based derivatives contracts of an entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer an offer of securities (not being sponsored depositary receipts, "SDRs") or securities-based derivatives contracts of an entity?
    `the securities are listed for quotation on an approved exchange, counting SDRs as section 273(1AA) says` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the securities of the entity listed for quotation on an approved exchange, counting SDRs with those securities as the underlying securities as section 273(1AA) says?
    `the entity is not formed or constituted in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the entity not formed or constituted in Singapore?
    `the listing is a primary listing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the listing on the approved exchange a primary listing?
    `the offer is made to existing members or debenture holders of that entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer made to existing members or debenture holders of the entity?
    `the offer is made to existing holders of SDRs with shares or debentures of that entity as the underlying securities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer made to existing holders of SDRs with shares or debentures of the entity as the underlying securities?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 273(1)(cd) the offer is an offer of securities of an unlisted entity, or a non-primary listing, to existing members, debenture holders or SDR holders` MEANS
    IF `the offer is an offer of securities (not being SDRs) or securities-based derivatives contracts of an entity` AND ((NOT `the securities are listed for quotation on an approved exchange, counting SDRs as section 273(1AA) says`) OR (`the entity is not formed or constituted in Singapore` AND `the securities are listed for quotation on an approved exchange, counting SDRs as section 273(1AA) says` AND (NOT `the listing is a primary listing`))) AND (`the offer is made to existing members or debenture holders of that entity` OR `the offer is made to existing holders of SDRs with shares or debentures of that entity as the underlying securities`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "it is an offer of securities (not being SDRs) or securities‑based derivatives contracts of an entity"
    -- FORK s273-1cd | s 273(1)(cd) | `s 273(1)(cd) the offer is an offer of securities of an unlisted entity, or a non-primary listing, to existing members, debenture holders or SDR holders` | took "formed or constituted in Singapore or otherwise" in sub-paragraph (i) as any entity, wherever formed, whose securities are not listed, and sub-paragraph (ii) as an entity not formed in Singapore whose securities are listed on a non-primary listing | other reading (i) limited to entities formed in Singapore or elsewhere by some other test | licence the text's own words; "whether or not the offer is renounceable" is not a condition and adds no input

-- src:43488 | (cda) it is an offer of SDRs, where the entity whose securities are
-- src:43489 | the underlying securities of those SDRs —
-- src:43491 | (i) is an entity which is formed or constituted in
-- src:43492 | Singapore or otherwise, and the securities or
-- src:43493 | securities‑based derivatives contracts of which are
-- src:43494 | not listed for quotation on an approved exchange; or
-- src:43496 | (ii) is an entity which is not formed or constituted in
-- src:43497 | Singapore, and the securities or securities‑based
-- src:43502 | derivatives contracts of which are listed for quotation
-- src:43503 | on an approved exchange and such listing is not a
-- src:43504 | primary listing,
-- src:43506 | (cda) and where the offer is made to —
-- src:43508 | (iii) existing members or debenture holders of that entity;
-- src:43509 | or
-- src:43511 | (iv) existing holders of SDRs with shares or debentures
-- src:43512 | of that entity as the underlying securities,
-- src:43514 | (cda) (called X in this paragraph), whether or not the offer is
-- src:43515 | renounceable in favour of persons other than X;
