-- src:43747 | (f) it is an offer of securities‑based derivatives contracts (not
-- src:43748 | being such excluded securities‑based derivatives contracts
-- src:43749 | as may be prescribed by regulations made under
-- src:43750 | section 341) where —
-- src:43752 | (i) the discharge of the obligations under, or the value
-- src:43753 | of, the securities‑based derivatives contracts is
-- src:43754 | determined wholly (whether directly or indirectly)
-- src:43759 | by reference to, is derived from, or varies by
-- src:43760 | reference to the value or amount of one or more
-- src:43761 | securities indices; and
-- src:43763 | (ii) an application has been or will be made for
-- src:43764 | permission for the securities‑based derivatives
-- src:43765 | contracts to be listed for quotation or quoted on an
-- src:43766 | approved exchange;
@ref s 273(1)(f) (src:43747-43766)
GIVEN
    `the offer is an offer of securities-based derivatives contracts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer an offer of securities-based derivatives contracts?
    `the Authority has prescribed the securities as excluded` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Authority prescribed the securities, units or contracts as excluded for the paragraph (excluded shares, excluded debentures, excluded units in a business trust, or excluded securities-based derivatives contracts, by regulations made under section 341)?
    `the discharge of the obligations under, or the value of, the contracts is determined wholly by reference to, is derived from, or varies by reference to the value or amount of one or more securities indices` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the discharge of the obligations under, or the value of, the contracts determined wholly (directly or indirectly) by reference to, derived from, or varying by reference to the value or amount of one or more securities indices?
    `an application has been or will be made for permission for the contracts to be listed for quotation or quoted on an approved exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has an application been made, or will one be made, for permission for the contracts to be listed for quotation or quoted on an approved exchange?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 273(1)(f) the offer is an offer of securities-based derivatives contracts determined by reference to securities indices` MEANS
    IF `the offer is an offer of securities-based derivatives contracts` AND (NOT `the Authority has prescribed the securities as excluded`) AND `the discharge of the obligations under, or the value of, the contracts is determined wholly by reference to, is derived from, or varies by reference to the value or amount of one or more securities indices` AND `an application has been or will be made for permission for the contracts to be listed for quotation or quoted on an approved exchange`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "it is an offer of securities‑based derivatives contracts (not being such excluded securities‑based derivatives contracts as may be prescribed by regulations made under section 341) where"

-- src:43768 | (g) it is an offer of securities‑based derivatives contracts (not
-- src:43769 | being such excluded securities‑based derivatives contracts
-- src:43770 | as may be prescribed by regulations made under
-- src:43771 | section 341) where —
